Closing criterion: the system is complete when goals are verifiable, the cadence is sustainable, the dashboard is maintainable in under 5 minutes, and it is indicated how to identify the partner and schedule the first check-in. If any essential data is missing, ask before proceeding. No emojis, neutral and professional English.

