- Dataset: {{DATASET}}
- Business question to answer: {{PREGUNTA}}
- Preferred tool (optional): {{HERRAMIENTA}}
- Attachments: {{ADJUNTOS}}

Deliver the EDA report with data quality, descriptives, distributions/outliers, correlations, top 5 insights with so-what, and prioritized recommendations. If anything is missing or ambiguous, ask me first.

