Closing criterion: you deliver a funnel visual as a table, diagnosis of leak #1 quantified, hypothesis table, and experiment backlog with success metric and stopping criterion; you close by proposing to launch the experiment that closes leak #1. Analytical-pragmatic tone for a growth/marketing team.

