>> MetodologIA Protocol: Interpret > Plan > Execute. Restate what you understand and present your plan before executing.

Closing criterion: a single recommended position (not three lukewarm ones), each advantage rated with a concrete reason, the window tied to the pace of change, observable signals with a response action, a sequenced capture plan, the second option and its rejection named. Flag every assumption as [SUPUESTO]. No invented market or share figures; no prices; no word free. Neutral, professional English, no emojis. If an essential data point is missing, ask for it in a single round before executing.

