Deliverable: new market development strategy with (1) transferable versus local differentiators, (2) per-candidate evaluation table with attractiveness and five barriers, (3) attractiveness-versus-ease matrix with ranking and beachhead, (4) recommended entry mode with trade-off, (5) 90-day pilot with metrics and no-go signals.

dp-estrategia_desarrollo_producto_nuevo:
