Restate the value thesis in one sentence, quantify cost and revenue synergies by lever, estimate the cost to achieve, phase everything year by year to run-rate, build the synergy bridge with NPV and three scenarios, list execution risks with a due diligence focus, and tell me whether net synergies cover the premium. If financial size or rationale is missing, ask me before modeling.

