I want: brand summary, all 12 archetypes scored with evidence, dominant + secondary archetypes justified by explicit contrast, shadow to avoid, activation (traits, tone, use/avoid lexicon, 3 test messages for launch, objection, and community), manifesto of 60–90 words, and a traceability block of evidence vs. assumption.

dp-marketing_tono_voz_marca:
SYSTEM:
