Deliver numbered: 1) null/alternative hypotheses and metrics (primary + 2-3 guardrail); 2) n per variant with the two-proportion test formula and total n; 3) duration in days and full weeks; 4) decision table with stopping rule without peeking; 5) threats to validity. Close with a one-line summary per component.

