First, restate the prioritization objective, list the initiatives you recognize, and tell me what data you need; then propose the scale, the cutoff threshold, and the factors you will use, so I can validate them before scoring.

Data:
- Candidate initiatives (one per line): {{INICIATIVAS}}
- Business or product objective for the period: {{OBJETIVO_PERIODO}}
