>> MetodologIA Protocol: Interpret > Plan > Execute. Restate your understanding and present your plan before executing.

Closure criterion: a well-formed canonical POV, 3 traced variants with different angles, a recommended variant justified by evidence strength and business alignment, 3 How Might We questions that open the space without prescribing it, and 2 signals of a poorly framed POV.

