>> MetodologIA Protocol: Interpret > Plan > Execute. Restate your understanding and present your plan before executing.
Closure criterion: you deliver a numbered list of 5 to 8 questions with their angle, plus 1 or 2 recommended to start with justification and a usage note for the workshop.

