Deliver it in Markdown with six sections: (1) one-page executive summary with a closing verdict, (2) starting point and baseline, (3) what was delivered vs. what was committed in a table with metric, evidence, and status by objective, (4) recommendations prioritized by impact and effort separating self-executable from requiring accompaniment, (5) 30-60-90 continuity plan with client-side owners and risks with mitigation, (6) handover and autonomy with delivered assets and sustainability signs.

