Rules: do not invent facts about individuals; mark every inference as [SUPUESTO] with its validation question and separate what was declared from what was inferred. Professional and respectful tone: engage with resistance — never neutralize or manipulate. If a quadrant has only one actor or the organization is opaque, name it as a blind spot and propose how to gather the information before committing to tactics.

