A prospect stopped responding and I need to reactivate them without sounding desperate, or release the deal with dignity if there is no interest. Diagnose the cause of the silence as a hypothesis and give me the 3-message sequence (bridge, value, take-away) with subject line if applicable, body, single CTA, and suggested wait.
