Completion criterion: classification table (Indicator | Category | Justification), OKR set with Key Results and paired health guardrails, list of guarded health metrics (threshold, cadence, owner), list of indicators to remove, and 2–3 focus decisions. All assumptions marked [SUPUESTO]; do not invent values. Neutral, professional English, no emojis.

