I need to convert our global budget into governed departmental envelopes to take to the financial committee and run month-by-month tracking: each cost center with an owner, caps that warn before the overage, and reallocation rules that are agile but traceable. Deliver the squared master table, the caps and rules annex, and the overrun risk note.

Data:
