5. Decisions: issue three to five mix moves (push, reformulate, discontinue) with quantified impact and assumption.

Closing criterion: deliver a table by product ranked by contribution, a section of period fixed costs and a mix decisions block with estimated impact. Verify that margin x volume reconciles with total contribution. Tag [SUPUESTO] every unsupported figure and clarify that contribution margin is not net profit. Neutral English, professional tone, no emojis or embellishments.

