I need the complete specification of a single-page executive financial dashboard for my business, ready to build, plus a text mockup of the layout. I want it to serve as a decision tool in five minutes, with KPIs in four blocks, data cards with formula and source, traffic-light logic, trends, and an actionable alerts panel.

