- Tool and constraints: {{HERRAMIENTA}}
- Required control level: {{NIVEL_CONTROL}}
- Attachments: {{ADJUNTOS}}

Deliver: (a) prioritized anti-pattern diagnostic by severity, (b) tab architecture with a one-direction flow, (c) formatting convention for inputs, formulas, and linked cells, (d) assumption-to-output traceability scheme, (e) control checks with sanity ranges and version log, and (f) risk-ordered migration plan with before-and-after validation.

dp-finanzas_auditoria_modelo_existente:
