Deliver: (1) the ready-to-paste system prompt with its five blocks; (2) the sufficiency criterion and [INFERENCIA] tagging; (3) conflict handling between chunks with both citations; (4) the actionable gaps section; (5) two test cases (one answerable, one unanswerable) with expected output and correct abstention. If any datum is missing, ask me or mark it [SUPUESTO] before drafting.

